","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"lTTmtjhLZIj6vWSuIOyxwQ","review_id":"GJVEB030ELriBtkqvzoxkA","date":"2019-07-26T17:47:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9321833252906799,"text_excerpt":"The turkey croissant I got here was super delicious! It was sort of slow moving because there was only one employee to make coffee and serve and checkout people but I eventually got my food and coffee. It is a small area for seating but it is chill. All of the pastries looked delicious, I will definitely go back again when I'm in the CBD."},{"business_id":"lTTmtjhLZIj6vWSuIOyxwQ","review_id":"OZJxdKWbqkUiy22tlQDEXA","date":"2018-07-12T19:41:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9297453165054321,"text_excerpt":"Amazing. Popped in here to try a chocolate croissant and baguette. Both were delicious. The croissant was perfectly flaky as it should be--not soft, like other bakeries in the area. The person working the counter was also friendly with a warm smile: which is, unfortunately, a rarity in New Orleans nowadays. Will definitely be back to try their sandwiches and coffee."},{"business_id":"lTTmtjhLZIj6vWSuIOyxwQ","review_id":"bFFcN5SUUGkVJ3Q39JWsxw","date":"2019-02-09T19:12:59","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9217947125434875,"text_excerpt":"I've only stopped in to get their savory pastries and coffee, but I must've come in at least ten times since I found this place a couple months ago. The person working at the counter has always been friendly and helpful. I hadn't tried the egg herb and cheese pastry until he pointed it one morning, and I had definitely been missing out. Do yourself a favor and try it, or try all 3 of their savory pastries, they've always hit the spot. Location is convenient and their food is always consistent, so I wouldn't be surprised if I find myself stopping in tomorrow."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"lTTmtjhLZIj6vWSuIOyxwQ","photo_id":"nzST8Eu-tKYECizTGN8m3Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/nzST8Eu-tKYECizTGN8m3Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8941827416419983},{"business_id":"lTTmtjhLZIj6vWSuIOyxwQ","photo_id":"-6ohZcR4DOrc3-bh64JdDw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/-6ohZcR4DOrc3-bh64JdDw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8881146907806396},{"business_id":"lTTmtjhLZIj6vWSuIOyxwQ","photo_id":"WUPLjInd7qIlJ5mOhHUkfA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/WUPLjInd7qIlJ5mOhHUkfA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8827015161514282},{"business_id":"lTTmtjhLZIj6vWSuIOyxwQ","photo_id":"cdnlMY140IxCAaDchhgyng","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/cdnlMY140IxCAaDchhgyng.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8593235015869141},{"business_id":"lTTmtjhLZIj6vWSuIOyxwQ","photo_id":"iZ0sGkmhu5QZxwaiIN5URQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/iZ0sGkmhu5QZxwaiIN5URQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8548092246055603}]},"notebook_case":null}
